   "description": "The chassis as Juniper ships MX10016-BASE. One routing and control board with a cover over the second slot. Five power supplies with a cover over each of the other five, fans, and a cover in each of the sixteen line-card slots. Line cards are ordered separately.",
   "kind": "base",
   "source": "vendor - Juniper publishes this as an orderable bundle. The hardware guide's 'MX10016 Components and Configurations' table (MX10016-BASE) lists one RCB, five power supplies with five power supply slot covers, and sixteen line-card covers, over the note that line cards and the cable management system are not part of the base configuration. This base draws exactly that: one board in RCB slot 0, five supplies and a cover in each of the other five supply slots, and a cover in each of the sixteen line-card slots. The table lists no cover for the second RCB slot and no part number for the supply covers; the slot is covered with JNP10K-RE-BLNK, named for the same cage in the MX10004 guide, and the supply covers are JNP10K-PWR-BLNK, named in the same guide. The five switch fabric boards and their cover (JNP10016-SF-BLNK) sit inside the chassis, not visible from outside, and no bay for them is drawn."
  },
