   "description": "MX10016-PREMIUM, the redundant AC configuration with JNP10K-PWR-AC2 supplies. Both routing and control boards, all ten power supplies, both JNP10016-FAN2 fan trays, and a cover in each line-card slot. Line cards are ordered separately.",
   "kind": "orderable",
   "source": "vendor - the hardware guide's 'MX10016 Components and Configurations' table lists the redundant AC configuration with JNP10K-PWR-AC2 components (MX10016-PREMIUM) in full: two RCBs, two fan tray controllers (JNP10016-FTC2), two fan trays (JNP10016-FAN2), ten AC power supplies (JNP10K-PWR-AC2), six switch fabric boards (JNP10016-SF2) and sixteen line-card covers, with no power supply or switch fabric covers because every slot is filled. This configuration draws all of that except the fan tray controllers and the switch fabric boards, which sit behind the fan trays and inside the chassis and have no bay or part here. The other generations (JNP10K-PWR-AC, the DC supplies) are not drawn."
  }
 },
